sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Provider as Service Provider Browser
    participant React as React Operator Portal
    participant Backend as Spring Boot REST API
    participant DB as MySQL Database

    Provider->>React: Login with ROLE_SERVICE_PROVIDER
    React->>Backend: POST /api/auth/login
    Backend-->>React: Return JWT Token with ROLE_SERVICE_PROVIDER claim

    Provider->>React: Open Venue Manager & Submit New Theatre
    React->>Backend: POST /api/provider/theatres (name, location, address)
    Backend->>DB: Insert Theatre (owner_user_id = currentUserId)
    Backend-->>React: Return Created Theatre

    Provider->>React: Open Movie Manager & Add Movie Release
    React->>Backend: POST /api/provider/movies (title, genre, language, duration)
    Backend->>DB: Insert Movie entity
    Backend-->>React: Return Created Movie

    Provider->>React: Open Show Scheduler & Submit Showtime Session
    React->>Backend: POST /api/provider/shows?movieId={id}&screenId={id}
    Backend->>DB: Insert Show entity
    Backend->>DB: Query Physical Seats for Screen & Auto-Populate ShowSeat Records
    Backend-->>React: Return Created Show & Seat Inventory Status
